{"suttaId":"thig6.3","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Thī","vriCode":"s0509m.mul","paras":[549,567],"vripara":"139"},"segments":{"thig6.3:0.3":"Khemātherīgāthā","thig6.3:1.1":"“Daharā tvaṃ rūpavatī, ahampi daharo yuvā;","thig6.3:1.3":"Pañcaṅgikena turiyena [tūrena (ka.)], ehi kheme ramāmase”.","thig6.3:2.1":"“Iminā pūtikāyena, āturena pabhaṅgunā;","thig6.3:2.3":"Aṭṭiyāmi harāyāmi, kāmataṇhā samūhatā.","thig6.3:3.1":"“Sattisūlūpamā kāmā, khandhāsaṃ adhikuṭṭanā;","thig6.3:3.3":"Yaṃ ‘tvaṃ kāmaratiṃ’ brūsi,‘aratī’ dāni sā mama.","thig6.3:4.1":"“Sabbattha vihatā nandī, tamokhandho padālito;","thig6.3:4.3":"Evaṃ jānāhi pāpima, nihato tvamasi antaka.","thig6.3:5.1":"“Nakkhattāni namassantā, aggiṃ paricaraṃ vane;","thig6.3:5.3":"Yathābhuccamajānantā, bālā suddhimamaññatha.","thig6.3:6.1":"“Ahañca kho namassantī, sambuddhaṃ purisuttamaṃ;","thig6.3:6.3":"Pamuttā [parimuttā (sī. syā.)] sabbadukkhehi, satthusāsanakārikā”ti.","thig6.3:7.1":"… Khemā therī …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
